### Python Scripts Overview

- `site_manager.py`: Unified CLI for all site automation. Subcommands: `build`, `serve`, `optimize` (WebP image conversion), `stats`, `test` (checks built site), `check` (validates media paths), `clean`.
- `scripts/update_frontmatter.py`: Keeps page frontmatter (`date`, `modified`, `description`, `tags`) in sync with git history and content. `--dates` refreshes dates only (used in CI), `--all` also fills missing descriptions/tags.
- `scripts/augment_movies_with_descriptions.py`: Enriches the movie list table via the OMDB API.